{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_title", "source_sha256": "ff9507e204a6beaa6a476e9b4997aeacfbc35225384514a545de9b9b77dc7411", "ja": "上手じゃないし、笑われちゃうけど", "zh": "虽然水平不高，也会被大家笑话，但是", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c4ffb79176e3e518988099c0f06c1be7f8faad7634c8e6135897676ba3831f19", "ja": "新曲披露に向けてのランニング中、可奈は\n泣いている男の子と出会う。歌で元気付けた\nものの、まだまだへたっぴ？と凹む可奈に、\n仲間達は「可奈の歌が好きだ」と告げる。\nそして公演当日、会場中に歌が響き渡る…。", "zh": "在为了发表新曲而跑步锻炼的途中，可奈\n遇到了一个正在哭泣的男孩子。虽然用歌声\n让他打起了精神，可奈还是因觉得自己水平不够\n而感到失落。这时同伴们对她说“我们喜欢可奈的歌声”。\n终于到了公演当天，歌声响彻了整个会场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5643f55a3e7a9ae5026e2a11cd8e70f64709d6e8fa0d80207da3d375a2772c53", "ja": "（可奈の新曲お披露目公演が終わった。お客さん達の\n温かな拍手が、途切れることなく続いている……）", "zh": "（可奈的新曲发布演出结束了。观众们温暖的掌声，一直没有停下……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "8062f3281bb85be44991be6f050513da2d9bbcdf962600adf4fea0a3f816f1f7", "ja": "{$P$}さぁ～ん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9da2297d69602ad80cd05adae68a10af696631a94e2e42f296953ea902c6368a", "ja": "可奈！", "zh": "可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "613f9eed7ceec93e84cddda17870ec03c9cea06dd74a4723558ab62fee22cf7c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、どうでした？\n私の歌、みんなを元気にできてましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，怎么样？\n我的歌声，有让大家都打起精神来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ad9acd808e9a652f4391261bcc8a0ed490c53c2ec82ea15edf4bcae6ed625c89", "ja": "ああ！\n可奈のおまじない、会場中に届いたと思うよ！", "zh": "啊！\n我觉得可奈的魔法已经传遍整个会场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "5787262264a2581adf644bd1ce77ddbc2b9fb00cf4ce4aa89f01672acff6f022", "ja": "わぁ、本当ですか？\nうれしいな～、えへ♪", "zh": "哇，真的吗？\n太开心啦～，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "721e7d612108c740c3bb18c118cacb75eb9cacf7f57ebfc8c0db882d323b2643", "ja": "はい！　可奈さんの優しい歌声が、\n会場中に広がって、弾けていって……。", "zh": "是的！可奈姐姐温柔的歌声，在整个会场回荡开来，绽放出无尽的活力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "d4a4ce6eab6f9725d2190ee8228ccfa7de4a79cfef2ec098a4fe773f34fbe991", "ja": "聴いてると、心の底から勇気がわいてくるような……\nでも、とっても優しくて楽しいライブだったよ！", "zh": "听着她的歌，仿佛勇气会从心底涌出来……总之，是一场非常温柔又欢乐的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "05665819209028382b2d9e859fccba4159a6d1f8f55c94c62d45d4484ce713ab", "ja": "なんか、心のエネルギーがぐーんって貯まる感じ？\nあとさ、かなりん気づいた？　あの子いたよね！？", "zh": "感觉心里一下子充满了力量？  \n还有啊，可奈，你注意到了吗？那个孩子也在吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a29e0a2ed3a01715c454bb3407b4f0cf30439817b3e52dc01b00e4e68759d647", "ja": "あの子？", "zh": "那孩子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "09c1baaca9a7162aa51923d629d0d6b3deb6c9836994ddc9eeddf22eaf9721f0", "ja": "はい！　ランニングの時に会ったあの男の子が、\n客席から手を振ってくれてたんです！　今日は笑顔で！", "zh": "对！就是跑步时遇到的那个男孩子，他在观众席上朝我挥手呢！今天还带着笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3b68b24ed9a6071fad65fa585182791b24ea7ca7697db2679a90447cd0767927", "ja": "あの時、泣いていた子か……。", "zh": "就是当时在哭的那个孩子啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1012_p", "source_sha256": "68e93db5a2d679aa4dd8bc4a406f9db31ecf4ed7d222ba7bc3a219007a009352", "ja": "そうか。可奈は言葉だけじゃなく、ステージでも\nちゃんとあの子を勇気づけてあげられたんだな！", "zh": "这样啊。可奈不仅用言语，还在舞台上好好地鼓励了那个孩子啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "57978ea6dd77d70c75954bf3aa056f355d8dbbdc951900da71649e0992af3122", "ja": "そうだといいなぁ。見て見てライブの可奈～♪\nそしたらきっと、笑顔かな～♪", "zh": "要是这样就好了。快看快看，舞台上的可奈～♪\n这样的话，她一定会露出笑容吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "b2879ba6889e257117fb90775b0b3d4d2e73229632d934755dd21cfb1e344b4e", "ja": "もう……すぐに調子に乗らないで。\n歌以外で、ミスしたところがあったでしょ。", "zh": "真是的……别马上就得意忘形。\n除了唱歌以外，也有出错的地方吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "023143a85a50310ddc0bf663da0b87bd86333035309cc7e7d043528ce65df986", "ja": "しほりん、厳しい～。でもしほりんって、\nかなりんのこと、よく見てるんだね！", "zh": "志保好严格啊～不过志保还真是一直在仔细观察可奈呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "9097f806a8a8be1e9a40328ffc0d429c042014f50d326758029ae1bd4210257e", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、それは、同じステージに立ってますし。\n可奈には、これでも足りないくらいですから。", "zh": "诶！？那、那是因为我们站在同一个舞台上嘛。\n对可奈来说，这点程度还远远不够呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "773feba0e8428a1713f2a6da9b9f7845fee3b034d29a119966ad3598eb3c43e0", "ja": "志保さんと可奈さんは、\nとっても仲良しなんですね♪", "zh": "志保和可奈关系真好呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "b0ed790844282f80937f2c9ab38e74df2f79cf74a22ae5639a88823b43e221ef", "ja": "うん、そうだね。\n志保ちゃんなりの愛のムチなんだと思う！", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n我觉得那是志保用她自己的方式表达爱的鞭策！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "e3748f484fbb53f9025f5837934ee341cdf8c8fccbfd1be5c009c705b774e7c1", "ja": "えっ！　そ、そうなのかな……？\nえへ、えへへへへ～♪", "zh": "诶！是、是这样吗……？\n嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿嘿～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "34a7bb710767849d96c9756ea1b9bb3c94bcb4d4b63bfaaa0bd59f8ada3dfc17", "ja": "はぁ……。よろこぶのもいいけど、ミスはミスでしょ。\n今度は間違えないように、明日からまたレッスンね。", "zh": "唉……。高兴归高兴，但错了就是错了吧。\n为了下次不再出错，从明天开始又要练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "8046fd680d689bb66c4e700bf0bf0449a43a1dd4f6d85850dc31db500edb9633", "ja": "ええ～！？　そんなぁ！\n公演、終わったばっかりなのに～。", "zh": "诶诶～！？怎么这样！\n演出才刚结束呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "988a43f852b4171cd85ffb58ee965cf7b16b3c234f0f85003e8243fdf4bb580c", "ja": "可奈が間違えたのが悪いんでしょ。", "zh": "是可奈搞错了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "6c6657246235f64a4621c458ac8e29866dece7172888975890c6279b8d2edbcb", "ja": "うう……。", "zh": "呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1024_p", "source_sha256": "02bde40c6947b2a5dfc2b4bec4e1cd102d91ec65f57395f35e689635ea79e1fa", "ja": "ま、まあまあ。この後は楽しい打ち上げだ。\nひとまずみんな、着替えてくるといい。", "zh": "嘛、总之。这之后就是开心的庆功宴了。\n大家先去换衣服吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "9bee1fe06cb5231d6fb5fa2ee7d4af79926b7a1bf612297e254e51acd62885ae", "ja": "はい♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "a05d6d0aa02375216294d34febe04eaa49b8eb574628b03b04d302ca683a29df", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n私にこの歌をくれて、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n谢谢您把这首歌交给我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "172e39c54131795c0e7a647b7d34c203087c7b1d1d6710424b8cc364ae3f7cd4", "ja": "{$P$}さんがこの歌をくれたから、\n私、お客さんを元気にできました！", "zh": "正因为{$P$}先生把这首歌给了我，\n我才能让观众们打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1032_p", "source_sha256": "cfa951a8f9a55eb2af4f0ae65de4142f9865524e4eb5f2e41edc4c565bd9083b", "ja": "うん。でも、この歌のおかげというよりは、\n可奈がこの歌を歌ったおかげだと思うな。", "zh": "嗯。不过，与其说是多亏了这首歌，\n我觉得不如说是多亏了可奈唱了这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "b66b4204b5b3a67aabe5a8427249fea8b5921d2305e199b4d66987ffc9ccdcdf", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "f8bea92ff49beb5a86c61cfe42161d712e3a63ae683f5f6922bcfb6c3f5ae773", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n私のおまじないは、届くと思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n您觉得，我的魔法能传达出去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1035_p", "source_sha256": "c8948e4fe8a63c931d75914237d03b6a2a4033086dd1ed1cb76dc87713e7a0a4", "ja": "もちろん。これからも、一緒に届けよう。\nもっと遠く……世界中の人たちに届くくらい！", "zh": "当然。今后也一起传递吧。\n传向更远的地方……远到全世界的人们都能收到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "08c9385d114cdc6714904de37695dbdcfe260ef7b776b1565d1365605b1fe197", "ja": "世界中……！　わかりました！　\n私、たっくさんがんばりますね！　えへっ♪", "zh": "全世界……！明白了！\n我会加倍努力的！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_058_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_058_1037_p", "source_sha256": "38e050f07744aac730667af56df16812d59606e4db85e391f41eb3952f8c325f", "ja": "（可奈のおまじないは、世界中に広がって多くの人を\n元気にしてくれるはず……その日が楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（可奈的咒语一定会传遍全世界，让许多人打起精神来……真期待那一天啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
